    "zh": "中央資管學士、碩士，專長時空網路（Spatio-Temporal Network）、LangChain Agent、FastAPI 與 Flask。碩士論文提出 SeqTAG，用條件式格蘭傑因果圖與圖卷積建構台灣股市投資組合。曾在台積電、工研院實習，也擔任統計與 Python 課程助教。",
    "en": "B.S. and M.S. in Information Management at NCU, working on spatio-temporal networks, LangChain agents, FastAPI and Flask. His thesis proposes SeqTAG, which builds Taiwan equity portfolios from conditional Granger causality graphs and graph convolution. He interned at TSMC and ITRI and taught as a statistics and Python TA."
